      "proposed_content": "Factor zeros become candidate spectral support for correlations: a global nonlocal field equation is decomposed into shell-by-shell distributional components. This exposes the physical sign and mass interpretation of factors, while shifting the unresolved burden to spectral weights, state-space structure, and positivity.",
